<title>UK: Excite launches European editions.</title>
<headline>Excite launches European editions.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excite Inc on Friday said it launched European editions of its Internet search engines, which will extend the reach of the Excite network, increase functionality and meet specific advertising requirements.</p>
<p>Excite said it launched local products in the UK, France, Germany and Sweden. The new products are designed to reflect on local needs and interests and use localised language capabilities.</p>
<p>The new products will allow advertisers to target specific country demographics, including targeting by language, Internet domain or by country.</p>
<p>Advertising sales for Excite in the UK are handled by TSMSi, the new media sales unit of United News &amp; Media Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Advertising Newsdesk +44 171 542 2815</p>
